      "The fixed snapshot helper exposes only the reviewed ABI surface, without transaction methods or address-scoped blocklist input. RPC endpoint selection uses host-managed environment settings, not caller ABI inputs. This is not an allowlist for host-authorized supplemental research or nonbroadcast simulation.",
      "Selected STANDARD and Trading Hook source/ABI reconciliation is review provenance, not verification of every module or current state.",
      "Burn totals do not attribute individual causes; restriction flags do not predict transaction success; epoch rollover remains an explicit evidence boundary.",
      "Current auction status uses snapshot.py auctions directly with packaged identities/ABI; no rediscovery, reindexing or history scan. Legacy license role authenticates history only.",
      "soldToday/remainingToday and stored currentDay may lag lazy rollover; no human24h sales recap or historical closing price is inferred. Exact cap-window math remains source-unverified.",
